Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:15:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(ui): workholding lives under Fixtures in every state

The Setups page showed the workholding block and tool list with no
setups, and neither the Setups nor the Setup<n> page showed it once a
setup existed. Workholding is now edited under Fixtures only: the
Setups page drops the block and tool list with or without setups, and
a Setup<n> page gets an "Open <name> fixtures" button on its Delete line.

Refs #1197

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
