From f9a0818e47bece30a42b3802868c4008d162cd21 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:15:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(ui): the Setup<n> Fixtures button activates its setup
 first

The button called only actions::target, so from an inactive setup it
opened a Fixtures page that refused edits ("not the active setup") and
showed no workholding. It now calls browser_pane::focus before target,
as the browser's Fixtures row and the Setups page's Open page button do.

Also: the Setups page and the implicit Settings page share one pointer
line (setup_pages::WORKHOLDING_POINTER), and the decision note names
effort:high and the right pinning test.

Fixes #1197
Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
